      "name": "lean-cache-manager",
      "title": "Lean cache manager — a sub-lane of the merge manager",
      "description": "The merge manager's Lean sub-lane: own the Lake cache branch and its addon overlays, run direct Lean verification (`lean` against the restored cache, plus `#print axioms`) for threads that have no Lean toolchain, watch the toolchain and Mathlib pins for drift, and keep the cache warm after every merge that touches Lean. Use for \"is the cache current\", \"run lean-direct on this\", \"the restore missed\", \"bump Lean / Mathlib\", \"contribute the oleans\", and whenever a merge request names a `.lean` file.",
